    "turn_idx": 42,
    "turn_text": "Well, let's talk about each of those. So I don't think a lot of people understand when you say clean the voter rolls, Democrats look on and say, oh, you're trying to exclude people from voting. But that's not what I believe, that's not what you believe, right? Explain what you think has to happen there.",
