    "turn_text": "throughout the entire book, but it's really kind of broken up in three primary sections. One, I was formerly a pastor before coming to Congress, and so a lot of people ask me all the time, how in the world does the pastor end up in Congress? So I'll talk a little bit about the background, however, uh, how that transition came about. And then there was a portion that deals with experiences in Congress. What was it like being in Congress and, uh, and then of course, what was difference",
