    "turn_idx": 91,
    "turn_text": "I mean, I talk about this a lot since the 1972 budget act. There's only one time we actually did it, start to finish in regular order. And voila, that's the one time Newt Gingrich was speaker. And Bill Clinton was president. That is the one time where the budget actually balanced.",
